{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 2:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Build sequence up to n\n    seq = [0, 1, 1]  # seq[0] unused, seq[1] = 1, seq[2] = 1\n    \n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        seq.append(seq[seq[i - 1]] + seq[i - seq[i - 1]])\n    \n    return seq[n]"}
