{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 2:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Build sequence up to n using the recurrence relation P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1))\n    seq = [0, 1, 1]  # seq[0] is unused, seq[1] = P(1) = 1, seq[2] = P(2) = 1\n    \n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        seq.append(seq[seq[i-1]] + seq[i - seq[i-1]])\n    \n    return seq[n]"}
