{"task_id": "Mbpp/119", "solution": "def search(arr):\n    # Use binary search to find the single element in O(log n) time\n    left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    \n    while left < right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        \n        # If mid is even, the pair should be at mid and mid+1\n        # If mid is odd, the pair should be at mid-1 and mid\n        if mid % 2 == 0:\n            if arr[mid] == arr[mid + 1]:\n                left = mid + 2\n            else:\n                right = mid\n        else:\n            if arr[mid] == arr[mid - 1]:\n                left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                right = mid\n    \n    return arr[left]"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/123", "solution": "def amicable_numbers_sum(limit):\n    def sum_of_proper_divisors(n):\n        # Sum of proper divisors (excluding n itself)\n        divisor_sum = 1\n        for i in range(2, int(n**0.5) + 1):\n            if n % i == 0:\n                divisor_sum += i\n                if i != n // i:\n                    divisor_sum += n // i\n        return divisor_sum if n > 1 else 0\n    \n    amicable_sum = 0\n    for num in range(1, limit + 1):\n        sum_divisors = sum_of_proper_divisors(num)\n        if sum_divisors != num and sum_of_proper_divisors(sum_divisors) == num:\n            amicable_sum += num\n    \n    return amicable_sum"}
