{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr, n, k):\n    \"\"\"Find the largest sum of contiguous subarray in array repeated k times.\"\"\"\n    if k == 1:\n        max_ending_here = max_so_far = arr[0]\n        for i in range(1, n):\n            max_ending_here = max(arr[i], max_ending_here + arr[i])\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n        return max_so_far\n    \n    # Calculate max subarray sum for single array\n    max_kadane = float('-inf')\n    max_ending_here = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        max_ending_here = max(arr[i], max_ending_here + arr[i])\n        max_kadane = max(max_kadane, max_ending_here)\n    \n    # Calculate prefix and suffix sums\n    prefix_sum = [0] * n\n    suffix_sum = [0] * n\n    prefix_sum[0] = arr[0]\n    suffix_sum[n-1] = arr[n-1]\n    \n    for i in range(1, n):\n        prefix_sum[i] = prefix_sum[i-1] + arr[i]\n    \n    for i in range(n-2, -1, -1):\n        suffix_sum[i] = suffix_sum[i+1] + arr[i]\n    \n    max_prefix = max(prefix_sum)\n    max_suffix = max(suffix_sum)\n    total_sum = sum(arr)\n    \n    # If total sum is positive and k > 2, we can benefit from middle repetitions\n    if total_sum > 0 and k > 2:\n        return max(max_kadane, max_suffix + max_prefix + (k-2) * total_sum)\n    else:\n        return max(max_kadane, max_suffix + max_prefix)"}
