{"task_id": "Mbpp/306", "solution": "def max_sum_increasing_subseq(arr, n, i, k):\n    # Find max sum of increasing subsequence from prefix until i, including element at k\n    dp_prefix = [0] * (i + 1)\n    dp_prefix[0] = arr[0]\n    \n    for j in range(1, i + 1):\n        dp_prefix[j] = arr[j]\n        for prev in range(j):\n            if arr[prev] < arr[j]:\n                dp_prefix[j] = max(dp_prefix[j], dp_prefix[prev] + arr[j])\n    \n    max_ending_at_i = max(dp_prefix)\n    \n    # Find elements <= i that can connect to k\n    valid_sum = 0\n    for j in range(i + 1):\n        if arr[j] < arr[k]:\n            valid_sum = max(valid_sum, dp_prefix[j])\n    \n    return valid_sum + arr[k]"}
