{"task_id": "Mbpp/306", "solution": "def max_sum_increasing_subseq(arr, n, i, k):\n    # Find max sum of increasing subsequence from prefix until i, including element at k\n    if i >= k or k >= n:\n        return 0\n    \n    # DP array to store max sum ending at each position up to i\n    dp = [0] * (i + 1)\n    dp[0] = arr[0]\n    \n    for j in range(1, i + 1):\n        dp[j] = arr[j]\n        for prev in range(j):\n            if arr[prev] < arr[j]:\n                dp[j] = max(dp[j], dp[prev] + arr[j])\n    \n    # Find max sum from prefix that can be extended to include arr[k]\n    max_sum = 0\n    for j in range(i + 1):\n        if arr[j] < arr[k]:\n            max_sum = max(max_sum, dp[j] + arr[k])\n    \n    return max_sum"}
