{"task_id": "Mbpp/311", "solution": "def set_left_most_unset_bit(n):\n    \"\"\"Set the leftmost unset bit in the binary representation of n.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Find the position of the most significant bit\n    temp = n\n    msb_pos = 0\n    while temp:\n        msb_pos += 1\n        temp >>= 1\n    \n    # Check if the bit at msb_pos is set, if not set it\n    bit_to_check = 1 << msb_pos\n    if (n & bit_to_check) == 0:\n        return n | bit_to_check\n    \n    # If msb+1 position bit is not set, set it\n    return n | (1 << msb_pos)"}
