{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum of first n Perrin numbers.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # First three Perrin numbers\n    if n == 1:\n        return 3\n    if n == 2:\n        return 3\n    if n == 3:\n        return 5\n    \n    # Generate Perrin sequence and sum\n    a, b, c = 3, 0, 2\n    total = 3\n    \n    for i in range(1, n):\n        next_val = a + b\n        total += next_val\n        a, b, c = b, c, next_val\n    \n    return total"}
