{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "def wind_chill(wind_velocity, temperature):\n    \"\"\"Calculate wind chill index using the standard formula and round up to next integer.\"\"\"\n    import math\n    \n    # Convert km/h to mph for the standard wind chill formula\n    wind_mph = wind_velocity * 0.621371\n    \n    # Convert Celsius to Fahrenheit\n    temp_f = (temperature * 9/5) + 32\n    \n    # Calculate wind chill in Fahrenheit using the standard formula\n    if wind_mph <= 3 or temp_f >= 50:\n        wind_chill_f = temp_f\n    else:\n        wind_chill_f = 35.74 + (0.6215 * temp_f) - (35.75 * (wind_mph ** 0.16)) + (0.4275 * temp_f * (wind_mph ** 0.16))\n    \n    # Convert back to Celsius\n    wind_chill_c = (wind_chill_f - 32) * 5/9\n    \n    # Round up to next integer\n    return math.ceil(wind_chill_c)"}
